# Everything the image build does not read. The Dockerfile copies `pyproject.toml`, `README.md`,
# `LICENSE`, `CHANGELOG.md` and `src/`; a context carrying `.git`, a previous `dist/`, a ledger or
# a virtualenv would make the image slow to build and easy to leak from.
.git
.github
.docket
.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.egg-info
dist
build
.coverage
htmlcov
deploy
docs
examples
spec
tests
verify-js
tools
assets
